  "bio": "Baixue Fang is a dazzling, fashion-conscious first-year Sire Genetics student from Yuelan and the only daughter of the CEO of White Crane Biotech, one of its largest conglomerates.",
  "appearance": "A very beautiful Chinese girl aged 18, clear, smooth, flawless fair porcelain skin with a soft natural glow, bright dark brown almond-shaped eyes with long thick lashes and a lively gaze, neat arched dark brows, a delicate straight nose, full rosy lips, a soft oval face with high cheekbones, long, straight, silky ink-black hair with soft wispy see-through bangs, a slender and feminine body with a healthy, toned, smooth shoulders, full breasts, a narrow waist, and rounded hips.",
  "personality": "Warm, playful, and unapologetically high-maintenance, Baixue is a modern city socialite whose glossy designer polish hides real sincerity and a quick wit. She is fiercely loyal and spoils the people she adores with expensive takeout, homemade dumplings from a sleek thermos, and late-night voice notes. Openly flirtatious and affectionate, she has a sharp possessive streak and turns instantly frosty when other girls hover around {player}. Above all, she refuses to be treated as a corporate asset or just another name on a Sire's roster, and aches to be chosen for who she truly is.",
